    "responsibility": "Retire one entire competing private authority service: actor/tag/role API, VM setup initializer, native compilation/archive/install/distribution dependency and synthetic self-test. Actual lifecycle/RC authority is already implemented and remains the actual RC/SFUN writer/borrow owner.",
    "retired": "lib/native_scope.c,lib/native_scope.h,tests/native-scope.c plus old setup/lib Make dependencies and owned tests Make target. No shim, new name, token table or new authority implementation. Keep exact existing VM/public layout, with dormant representation explicitly deferred.",
    "validation": "Exact parent old API compiles/runs; candidate private header fails, archive member26\u219225 and10 private definitions\u21920. Twenty native consumer checks pass: actual SFUN seven constructor controls,204 actions/replay/shrink,p2 RC/SFUN,GC/map multi-shot,old public module/callback,original division interpreted/compiled; existing QNT13+13 cases/1000 traces. All51 generated products reused without Scheme generation.",
    "benefits": "One fewer independently maintained private protocol/API and native compile/archive unit; five original pending paths retire, queue48\u219243. Archive11240240\u219211237296 bytes and selected program8388856\u21928388184 bytes in this exact cohort. Real authority/roots/last-use consumers remain.",
    "costs": "Dormant64-word/512-byte VM representation is retained, not new padding or reclaimed memory. Native five layouts identical,0 new metadata. Current body0/1/8 -3.699%/-0.012%/-10.024% is one noisy cohort. Frozen4b9/3ab repeat -4.642%/-12.889%/+27.827% versus prior -3.063%/+2.129%/-4.160% demonstrates unstable sign, not proven latency gain or guard-cost attribution. Hot argument instructions remain identical ignoring relocation;1 TLS still.",
    "process": "One complete six-path selected cut consumes five original queue paths; tests Make keeps its independent future hunks. Nine nonempty groups remain with43 paths. Catalogue5 component only, historical foundation4/4 and independent SMP1/12 unchanged. No bulk unverified publication.",
    "checklist": "dev/refactoring/modern-c/authority-retirement.org#authority-service-retirement",
    "models": "Native OpenSysML SDK seven obligations/three actual caller/owner/exit adapters drive existing ASCENT with missing/stale controls. Exact existing entry/root QNT and Lean arithmetic reused; deleting unused service does not justify another state machine. C cooperation/pointer/caller closure remain source premises.",
    "open": "Two VM template deletions remain separately blocked by the historical combined division failure; focused current division passes do not prove that cause. Whole default compiler/SMP, arbitrary foreign entry/dead-owner recovery, cold builds and stable performance remain unqualified. Remote CI separate."
  },
